    "body": "Repaired the mangled FF8 Enemies detail view. Scan, compact properties, stat curves, and each editable sub-table now form one vertical scrolling document; the stat section owns its height, so Abilities can no longer draw over the graphs. The rendered view shows readable property controls and four charts per row. Enemy binary, save/readback, live-reference, and rendered editor checks pass. Please restart Lexeditor and inspect an enemy with all extracted data.",
